    "Transverse equitable multiplicity", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "50a02034-8b88-4b6e-a9f7-f6ffe6202115"], Cell["\<\
For each base vertex, the inner multiplicity association is constant \
throughout its fiber\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2253b9c3-c13e-4e44-8c8d-a8a4e12dd5c6"], 
    Cell["Read with InfraEdgeLiftMultiplicity", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "b885bfd6-b1f1-4051-ac47-3610619a2644"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"381c093c-8c12-4405-b743-\
0916f8044f29"],

Cell["\<\
The last row is a condition one can read from the existing measurement; it \
adds no predicate. A full equitable partition also requires constant vertical \
degree within each fiber. The local injectivity and surjectivity rows concern \
transverse neighbours only. They are exact finite conditions, without a \
chosen topology on the vertices.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b4d33b45-c3f7-4f49-8a11-9fe472063a8c"],

Cell["\<\
Here one transverse edge reconstructs a base edge, but two total vertices \
have no lift of it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0acc051d-6de2-4ed9-bb77-8322793dc26f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", " ", "7", " ", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"With", "[", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", " ", 
    RowBox[{"fib", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"InfraFiberedGraph", "[", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Graph", "[", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Range", "[", " ", "4", " ", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", " ", 
          RowBox[{"UndirectedEdge", "[", " ", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], " ", "]"}], " ", "}"}]}], " ", "]"}],
        ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"<|", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<p\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<p\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"3", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<q\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"4", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<q\>\""}]}], " ", "|>"}]}], " ", 
      "]"}]}], " ", "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"{", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"InfraFiberedGraphHighlight", "[", " ", "fib", " ", "]"}], ",", 
     " ", 
     RowBox[{"InfraEdgeLiftMultiplicity", "[", " ", "fib", " ", "]"}]}], " ", 
    "}"}]}], " ", "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"4177ff0a-015e-4be9-a8c1-11dfabd1c3c3"],

